silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_04_sections_01_concrete_anchor_2#headprobearrow44 silm:hasLongDescription "The HeadProbeArrow44 is the test probe arrow X -> HeadObs77. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'a', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
